<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MCI Communications cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MCI Communications cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities downgraded MCI Communications Corp to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Late on Thursday, MCI said it expects its earnings for the second half of 1997 and into 1998 to be below current Wall Street expectations due to delayed entry into U.S. local phone service markets.</p>
</text>
